/span><p><span>Caminito旁边的街球场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8spbdod3Io5wNlOPeFlZ8La-_V.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>比赛前的球迷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr8YBbcd3DTYe0Gh5HLkFDjMFu8x.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlvFdSe52tNc2rNqJIc9OyYfhk3y.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2QYudpho-UDwciMbzl2dfCuW06.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsrp-kdO7-OzeDs8S45XAD-k59ip.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Exequiel Zeballos庆祝进球（网络/beIN Sports）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfoFEiIvMV8aEQ_hkMwenkqNjam.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看台上的Dua Lipa（网络/ESPN）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvuSSMSB5uUZGJdUluEu5A0PtARN.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>来自那不勒斯的传奇球星卡瓦尼（受伤）在博卡替补席上庆祝（网络/TNT）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsq1CMY3bSD1NZdnzvcyahfMwMjG.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYkm9hwaaU0YxI7V7vE5DkZP_Sk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZE9NT-HOduFl_ZQtT2RxbDZfXc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>从公寓楼看过去的糖果盒球场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSkBz2kP4tdiElZcLwDHuW1P0JO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-mdZsQr7CcYCQM_9wP9a4VFR7o.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRudLAZi8YZSwX7f1lbBw6KhY__.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>热那亚上赛季发布的博卡主题球衣​​​（网络 @genoacfc）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmXoeL9QRwiFKBrzjB3IJmgKZjw7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>德罗西问帕雷德斯要票（如果没接手热那亚，他也会出现在球场）</span></p>]]></description>
